{"id":"word:hebrew:H1008","type":"word","title":"בֵּית־אֵל","subtitle":"H1008 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"Beth-El , a place in Palestine","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to בֵּית־אֵל (H1008) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-pr-loc.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 72 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"בֵּית־אֵל (Bêyth-ʼÊl) means Beth-El , a place in Palestine First listed occurrence: 1Chr 7 28."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"בֵּית־אֵל","transliteration":"Bêyth-ʼÊl","pronunciation":"bayth-ale'","strong":"H1008","lemmaId":"hebrew:H1008","partOfSpeech":"n-pr-loc","forms":["אֵ֔ל","אֵ֑ל","אֵ֖ל","אֵֽל","אֵל֙"],"morphs":[["HNp",72]]},"definitions":{"short":"Beth-El , a place in Palestine","usage":"Beth-el.","full":"H1008. Betheel ֵבּיתְאֵל 71 proper name, of a location Bethel (so read, not בֵּיתאֵֿל as Josh 7:2 + according to see d. H; compare Baer Gen 12:8 ; house of God , or house of El ) — 1 ancient place and seat of worship in Ephraim on border of Benjamin, identification with Luz (former name) Gen 28:19 ; 35:6 ; Josh 18:13 ; Judg 1:23 ; apparently distinguished from Luz Josh 16:2 (yet compare Di); name connected with vision of Jacob when journeying to Paddan-Aram (JE) Gen 28:19 ; 35:7 (where ֵבּיתְאֵל אֵל , but ᵑ9 ᵑ6 ᵐ5 Ol strike out אֵל ; Di maintains); compare Hosea 12:5 ; when journeying from P.-A. Hos 35:15 (P); name apparently given first to a stone ( Gen 28:18 ; 35:14 ) compare We Skizzen iii. 70 ; ֵבּיתְאֵל הַר 1Sam 13:2 ; later important place of worship 10:3 בֵּיתְאֵל הָאֱלֹהִים אֶלֿ עָלָה ; abode of prophet 1Kin 13:11 ; 2Kin 2:3 ; Jeroboam set up one of the golden calves at Bethel 1Kin 12:29 f. compare also 13:1 f; 2Kin 10:29 ; 23:15 ; Jer 48:13 see further 2Kin 17:28 ; 23:15 Th proposes on internal grounds, אַל בֵּית house of nothingness , or ׳בּ אָלָה house of execration ; ׳בּ אָלָה also Ren Hist. iii. 185 ; in prophets Amos 3:14 ; 4:4 ; 5:5 (twice in verse); 5:6 ; 7:10 , 13 ; Hosea 10:15 ; note especially Amos 5:5 לְאָ֑וֶן יִהְיֶה ביתאל , & אָוֶן בֵּית ( house of iniquity ) as substitute for ביתאל Hosea 4:15 ; 5:8 ; 10:5 ( און בית עֶגְלוֺת ); — modern Beitîn Rob BR i. 448 f. Guérin Judée iii. 14-27 compare Bd Pal 215 Survey ii. 305. 2 place in south country of Judah, not far from Beersheba & Ziklag 1Sam 30:27 compare We Dr; = כסיל ᵑ0 Josh 15:30 (text error; ᵐ5 Βαιθηλ ); also בְּתוּל 19:4 , בְּתוּאֵל 1Chr 4:30 .","rootNote":"from 1004 and 410 ; house of God;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 7 28","keyReferences":["1Chr 7 28","1Kgs 12 29","1Kgs 12 32","1Kgs 12 32","1Kgs 12 33","1Kgs 13 1","1Kgs 13 4","1Kgs 13 10"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":72,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 7 28","book":"1Chr","chapter":7,"verse":28,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אֵ֖ל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Kgs 12 29","book":"1Kgs","chapter":12,"verse":29,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אֵ֑ל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Kgs 12 32","book":"1Kgs","chapter":12,"verse":32,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אֵ֔ל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Kgs 12 32","book":"1Kgs","chapter":12,"verse":32,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אֵ֔ל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Kgs 12 33","book":"1Kgs","chapter":12,"verse":33,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אֵ֗ל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Kgs 13 1","book":"1Kgs","chapter":13,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אֵ֑ל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Kgs 13 4","book":"1Kgs","chapter":13,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אֵ֔ל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Kgs 13 10","book":"1Kgs","chapter":13,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אֵֽל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Kgs 13 11","book":"1Kgs","chapter":13,"verse